    "detailed_description": "A zombie outbreak has taken out the artificial settlement Ziltron. Their origin is unknown, all communication seems to be lost, so now Earth sends its greatest hope, the Space Marines. Their goal, rescue any survivors, and discover the source behind this sudden outbreak. There are multiple paths to take through Ziltron, what will you discover, who will you rescue? Are you ready to finally play the hard as nails platform shooter from 2008? You better be because their fate, their lives, are all in your hands... get ready for Soulless, a pre-rendered run 'n' gun platformer from the past fully restored using Stencyl!<br><br>Features <br>\u20229 Playable characters <br>\u202210 Missions <br>\u202221 Stages <br>\u2022Boss Battles <br>\u2022Player performance rankings <br>\u2022Individual Survivor endings<br><br>Their mission objectives:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover the source of the outbreak<br></li><li>Rescue any survivors<br></li><li>Eliminate all hostile presence<br><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 Playable characters to rescue<br></li><li>10 Missions<br></li><li>21 Levels in total<br></li><li>Final boss battle on the 10th mission<br></li><li>Player performance rankings<br></li><li>Individual Survivor endings<br></li><li>Gallery<br></li><li>Music selection from the original and all new music</li></ul></li></ul>",
